direction: right
Users: Global users {shape: person}
DNS: Global traffic manager {shape: cloud}
RegionA: Region A {
  LB: Load balancer {shape: hexagon}
  App: Application cluster {shape: rectangle}
  DB: Regional database {shape: cylinder}
}
RegionB: Region B {
  LB: Load balancer {shape: hexagon}
  App: Application cluster {shape: rectangle}
  DB: Regional database {shape: cylinder}
}
Users -> DNS
DNS -> RegionA.LB: nearest healthy
DNS -> RegionB.LB: nearest healthy
RegionA.LB -> RegionA.App
RegionA.App -> RegionA.DB
RegionB.LB -> RegionB.App
RegionB.App -> RegionB.DB
RegionA.DB -> RegionB.DB: replicate
RegionB.DB -> RegionA.DB: replicate
